Baseline: Discovery

Purpose:
  Defines discovery baseline — snapshot of project state at
  discovery time for future comparison.

BaselineStructure:
  Project:
    <project-name>

  Mode:
    GREENFIELD | BROWNFIELD | HYBRID

  Timestamp:
    <discovery-timestamp>

  DiscoveryScore:
    Overall: <percentage>
    Structure: <percentage>
    Stack: <percentage>
    Architecture: <percentage>
    Testing: <percentage>
    Security: <percentage>
    Infrastructure: <percentage>
    Documentation: <percentage>

  UnknownBudget:
    Unknown: <percentage>

  Discovered:
    Structure:
      - <list>
    Stack:
      - <list>
    Architecture:
      - <list>
    Domains:
      - <list>
    Tests:
      - <list>
    Security:
      - <list>
    Infrastructure:
      - <list>
    Documentation:
      - <list>

  Conflicts:
    - <list of conflicts>

  Gaps:
    - <list of gaps>

  ActionableBacklog:
    - <list of tasks derived from gaps>

BaselineRules:
  [BL1]  Baseline MUST be created after every discovery.
  [BL2]  Baseline MUST be immutable after creation.
  [BL3]  Future discoveries MUST compare against baseline.
  [BL4]  Baseline MUST include discovery score and unknown budget.

State: +
  